WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.750
Rumi! Make sure you keep hold of Dad's hand, all right?

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.450
So you show yourself, monster!

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.070
Precure! Open My Heart!

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.520
It's the new issue of Precure!

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:24.830
Make sure you all buy it!

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.210
Wow, this does look good!

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.950
I'll take a copy too!

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.030
This one's really pretty!

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.360
Yeah, it is.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.120
But this one's really good too!

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.960
It's a really great shot.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:41.060
Huh? Nishihara, you did come after all!

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.390
I love you!

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:46.900
And I, you! Never again shall I let you go!

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.400
Nor shall I!

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:52.070
<i>But little did they know the scale of what awaited them.</i>

00:00:54.730 --> 00:00:57.070
We'd better get a move on with our rehearsal.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:57.620
Yeah.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:00.080
That reminds me, where are Aya and Mayu?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.340
Dunno.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.250
Fashion Club now preparing

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.250
Fashion Club now preparing

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.250
Non-members are
 strictly prohibited

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.250
No entry!

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:05.920
Momoka's outfit is all ready!

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:07.390
What about Yuri's?

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:10.350
Erika's just shortening the skirt on it a little.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.090
Erika!

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.030
I'm nearly done!

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.220
Naminami, how's the corsage repair coming along?

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:17.470
I'll be finished in a sec. What about Tsubomi?

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:18.180
I-I'm here!

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.220
Are you all right?!

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.060
I-I'm fine...

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:28.520
Oh no, the outfits!

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:34.530
Don't tell me...

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.310
Are you nervous?

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.720
I-I feel like if I stop moving, I'm just gonna faint.

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.660
We can't give up after coming this far!

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:48.120
Being nervous won't get you anywhere! Okay?

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:51.480
Sometimes I envy how laid back Erika can be.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.500
She's just optimistic to a fault.

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.960
It's not a fault!

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:00.510
<i>I know they say, "Do your best
 and leave the rest to Providence."</i>

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.990
<i>But my heart won't stop racing!</i>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.180
HeartCatch

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:08.640
Precure!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.230
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.190
Now, all together

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.700
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.280
Within each of our chests,

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:30.950
they begin to sprout

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.630
The seeds of the heart

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:33.920
are growing

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.510
bit by bit

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.170
Red,

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:37.790
white

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.110
and yellow

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.840
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.300
all varied colors

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.780
that they

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.970
shine so brightly!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:52.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.770
with such care

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.490
will never wither

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.950
Now, all together

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.410
HeartCatch Precure!

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.080
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:14.020
They're always right by our sides

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:14.850
So together

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:18.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.630
bloom even more!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.140
HeartCatch

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.690
Precure!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:34.190
Sorry to keep you waiting! 
Here are your teas and coffees!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.920
Wait... what?! Dad?! Mom?!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:40.820
What're you doing here?! What about the shops?!

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.200
We've taken the day off.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.570
It's our daughters' big day, after all.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.030
We're really looking forward to your fashion show.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.410
Yeah.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.000
But I must say...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.370
I must say...

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.130
Those outfits look really cute on you!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:01.090
Sir, please refrain from taking photos within the café!

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.630
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.470
Tsubomi! Erika!

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:06.100
Oh, Itsuki!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.310
They've finally confirmed this afternoon's schedule for the main stage.

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:11.310
Here's the stage program, and the...

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:12.480
Huh?!

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:16.110
Dad, Mom, big brother! Grandpa's here too?!

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:18.910
We're expecting good things from your fashion show.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.740
Make sure you give it your all, okay?

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:23.260
I-I will!

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.530
Can I have a word with you two?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.750
So the fashion show's after the 
Light Music Club goes on, huh?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.870
And then after us is...

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:38.590
What the hell?!

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.420
We're the headline show?!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.800
Apparently.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.260
We're the very last thing on the schedule.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:45.310
Huh?

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.100
Whaaaaat?!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:56.600
Everyone's a Star<i>!</i>

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:56.600
Everyone's a Star<i>!</i>

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.560
Whoa!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.980
What a huge stage!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.070
Thish ish amazing!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.790
This is where you're holding your fashion show?!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:05.240
Yeah.

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:10.200
But it's kind of tradition for the Light Music Club to be the closing performance of the day.

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:12.620
Wh-What are we gonna do?!

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:17.540
Now I'm really fired up!

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:22.260
If this is how it's gotta be, we're just gonna have to roll with it and make the fashion show a huge success!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:23.920
That's right!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.970
As a member of the Fashion Club,

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:30.530
and as a member of the School Festival Committee,

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:33.180
I want to make this the most 
amazing fashion show possible!

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:34.140
Yeah.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:42.610
But hey, isn't the Light Music Club gonna be a bit annoyed with us for this?

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.650
I was worried about that too.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.320
I'm gonna head over there now and talk to them.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:49.840
I'll come with you!

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.030
I'll come too!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.410
Okay!

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:55.250
You can't just back out now!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.120
There's just no way we can do it!

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.670
It's just out of our league!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.630
Damn it! I guess we're out of options.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.000
Please stop!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.840
Stop that this instant!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:04.590
We're begging you!

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.720
We're so sorry!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.590
Huh?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.850
Aya! Mayu!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.060
Damn it!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.150
Damn, that was bad timing.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.440
S-Sorry.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.360
What on earth just happened?

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:26.620
It's our vocalists, Aya and Mayu.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.610
They said they wanted to cancel today's concert!

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.320
Huh?!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:35.510
Apparently we're having a fashion show this year, and Kurumi Momoka's gonna be in it.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:37.200
Everyone's gonna be there to see her.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.960
It seems they got cold feet.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:46.330
Sorry. Truth is, I'm the president of the Fashion Club.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:46.960
Huh?!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.840
And we actually came here to tell you all

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:54.780
that this year, the Fashion Club's been put last in the schedule.

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:56.720
I'm really sorry about all this!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:07:00.140
Don't. We should be thankin' you, if anything.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.660
The bigger the audience, the better, right?

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:06.190
But what about Aya and Mayu?

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.820
We'll just have to find 'em and change their minds!

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:12.680
There's no point doin' this without 'em.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:16.870
We've gotta let our spirits burn bright on stage together!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.870
Right!

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:27.250
Um, do you mind if we help find them?!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.320
Yeah! Let's do it!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:31.420
We'll help look too!

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:32.220
That'sh right!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.260
Okay!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.140
M{*\c&H2E4A58&}youdou Sch{*\c&H2F4A58&}ool Festival

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.140
M{*\c&H5BE2F0&\3c&H5BE2F0&}y{*\c&H5DE2F1&\3c&H5DE2F1&}o{*\c&H5FE2F2&\3c&H5FE2F2&}ud{*\c&H6EE5F3&\3c&H6EE5F3&}o{*\c&H7CE7F3&\3c&H7CE7F3&}u {*\c&H97EBF4&\3c&H97EBF4&}S{*\c&HA5EDF4&\3c&HA5EDF4&}c{*\c&HB3EFF4&\3c&HB3EFF4&}ho{*\c&HC0F2F5&\3c&HC0F2F5&}o{*\c&HBFF2F5&\3c&HBFF2F5&}l {*\c&HBDF2F6&\3c&HBDF2F6&}F{*\c&HBCF2F6&\3c&HBCF2F6&}e{*\c&HBCF3F7&\3c&HBCF3F7&}s{*\c&HBBF3F7&\3c&HBBF3F7&}t{*\c&HBAF3F7&\3c&HBAF3F7&}i{*\c&HB9F3F8&\3c&HB9F3F8&}v{*\c&HB8F3F8&\3c&HB8F3F8&}al

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.140
The Myoudou School Festival?

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:43.060
"Our students will be showing off all the hard work they've put into their club activities, live on stage," is it?

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:50.280
I'm sure everyone would much rather see my beautiful visage upon their stage than that dross, non?

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.060
Please, just think it over!

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:17.880
Sorry!

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:19.390
We just can't sing today!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.770
We'll be waiting for you on stage, all right?!

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:23.970
We'll wait as long as it takes!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.570
We're sorry!

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:28.630
Aya!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.280
Mayu...

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:37.620
Hey.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.550
Are you really all right with this?

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:42.890
You won't regret it?

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:47.950
You can do it!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.340
'Cause, ya know, you're not alone in this.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.050
Aya, Mayu.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:03.200
To be honest, I'm really frightened of going up on stage too.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:09.450
But I have all these great friends who support and believe in me, so I know I can do it!

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:13.770
All your friends from the Light Music Club believe in you two as well.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.270
We'll be waiting for you on stage!

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:27.290
Next up, we have a performance by the Light Music Club.

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:31.840
W-Wait!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.260
You'll be fine, really!

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.720
Aya! Mayu!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.140
Go for it! You can do it!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.120
Let's do this!

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:43.850
Yeah!

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:12.340
We can't do this after all!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.520
Well then, I guess this stage...

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:19.000
will have to be commandeered!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:22.680
Kobraja!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:29.900
Bow down before my beauty, my dear humans!

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.100
Get off the stage!

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.550
You philistine!

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.760
That shall do nicely!

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.490
I shall take the Flowers from both your Hearts!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.450
Flowers of the Heart, your moment has come!

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:51.250
There we go!

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.470
And now, behold the power of the Dark Bracelet!

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:59.090
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:05.770
Sing a song!

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:07.630
Come on, you three!

00:11:07.630 --> 00:11:08.230
Yuri!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:10.470
Hurry and transhform into Precuresh!

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:11.060
Right!

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:23.370
Go, Seeds of the Precure!

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:27.310
Precure!

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.040
Open My Heart!

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.520
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.670
Cure Blossom!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.940
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:32.250
Cure Marine!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.670
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.330
Cure Sunshine!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:45.050
A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.700
Cure Moonlight!

00:13:00.810 --> 00:13:05.220
I'm just so scared people won't like our singing!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:09.150
Blossom!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.390
Maybe we don't have any talent after all.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.160
That's what we're afraid of!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.010
We want to sing,

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.210
but we just can't!

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:42.050
Aya, Mayu, your friends in the Light Music Club are there to support you, so please believe in them!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:44.480
If your friends believe in you,

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:47.260
then you've gotta be able to believe in yourself too!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.150
You two have what it takes to sing up on stage!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.070
I suppose I should make my debut.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:14:00.600
Sink into the darkness, and let your dark heart control you!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.840
Dark Bracelet!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:17.250
Rather than listen to these cowards sing, I shall treat you to one of my glorious rhapsodies!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:29.680
Just stay still, will you?!

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:41.160
Curse you. Take this!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.700
Get them!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.420
Believing? Friends? How utterly ridiculous!

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:57.840
Cowards like them will always be cowardly!

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.250
They'll never accomplish anything!

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:00.920
No.

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.000
You're wrong!

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.670
Because people believe in us, we can give our all.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:11.140
Because our friends are there for us, we get stronger!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.600
And you dare to mock that?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.640
I've had it up to here with this!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:30.360
Gather, Floral Power!

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.270
Shiny Tambourine!

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.590
Flowers, dance for me!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:55.680
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:16:02.180 --> 00:16:05.430
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:12.070
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:25.070
Precure Shining Fortissimo!

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:31.110
Heart Catch!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.570
I-I won't forget this!

00:16:54.020 --> 00:16:55.670
Aya! Mayu!

00:16:58.260 --> 00:16:59.780
Are you two all right?!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:00.620
Yeah...

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:07.750
<i>Would the members of the Fashion Club please report backstage?</i>

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:11.800
All that chaos out there kinda took up our timeslot.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.260
Looks like we're not gonna have our concert this year.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.720
But hey, there's always next year, right?

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.210
I'm so sorry!

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:21.720
We didn't have the courage to perform, and now...

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.390
Don't sweat it.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:26.310
Oh!

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:32.020
This is kinda sudden, but I think we
 can change up our production a bit!

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:32.880
What?

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:36.610
Sorry about this!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:44.830
Without further ado, the Fashion Club and the Light Music Club will now present their fashion show!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:24.860
The feelings that got me here all seemed so half-hearted

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:28.460
But there's no turning back now

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:37.630
I just have to trust in all my hard work, and take the first step

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:42.670
Now's the time to take the plunge, ready, go!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.640
So no matter how afraid we feel

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.840
We'll never give up, cause even though you can't see it

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:56.900
We've found a treasure more precious than any other

00:18:56.900 --> 00:19:02.350
In the sunny skies of my heart

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:09.920
I soar into a higher octave

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:16.590
My heart goes on, and when it resounds with all of my friends

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:24.510
Those distant dreams can one day become reality

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:42.720
I think our limits are just an illusion we make because we're afraid

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.980
I've come to understand that now

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:55.650
